+    // encounter's writes -- btlSubMapNo = group, SetNextMap(scene) (the private SetBattleScene's public twin), isRandomEncounter
+    // = isEncount = rand (ProcessEncount's pair; false = the scripted Battle's write) -- plus the field verb's two "it must be
+    // able to END" writes (isDebug and mappingBattleIDWithMapList false: nothing on the world path clears a diorama's stranded
+    // isDebug) and KillCountdown, and turns the tick's 0 into 3, so case 3 is the engine's own. The writes wait for that tick:
+    // a one-shot that is dropped leaves nothing behind (a stray isEncount true would hold WorldHUD's full-map button shut). The
