+    // encounter, a Field() exit) drops the battle, so the world's own transition wins. A stale one-shot is dropped too: older
+    // than WorldBattleArmMs, or armed on an earlier world load (w_frameCounter restarts at 0). The hot path is one static read,
+    // and it never throws into the world tick.
+    public static Boolean TakePendingWorldBattle(Int32 frameResult)
+    {
+        if (!_worldBattleArmed)
